  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "美琴ーーー！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "se": "0327"
  },
  {
    "id": 6025001090030,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "ふっ……あはは\r\nそんなに、叫ばなくても……",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602500109/6025001090030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え…………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6025001090040,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "ごめんね、\r\n最初から聞こえていたの",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602500109/6025001090040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なんだ……\r\n無駄に叫んじゃったじゃないか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6025001090050,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "いつもこうやって呼んでくれてたの\r\n初めてちゃんと聞けたかもしれない",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602500109/6025001090050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは……そうだな\r\n美琴はいつも、呼んでもなかなか気付いてくれないから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……って、\r\nこんなことを言いに来たんじゃないんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6025001090060,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger1_s",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602500109/6025001090060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……美琴\r\n『W.I.N.G.』優勝、おめでとう……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "完璧なステージだった\r\n……感動したよ、すごく",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6025001090070,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_left",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger1_s",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602500109/6025001090070"
  },
  {
    "id": 6025001090080,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "──死んじゃうのかもって思ったの",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602500109/6025001090080"
  },
  {
    "id": 6025001090090,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "優勝した時、\r\n今までのことが全部見えたから",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602500109/6025001090090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えっ……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6025001090100,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "走馬灯っていうのかな、ああいうの",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602500109/6025001090100"
  },
  {
    "id": 6025001090110,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "やっぱり、ほとんど背景がレッスン室だったの\r\nおかしいでしょ？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602500109/6025001090110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……美琴は２８３プロに来てからも\r\nずっと、そうだったもんな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6025001090120,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "そうだね",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602500109/6025001090120"
  },
  {
    "id": 6025001090130,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "レッスン室の鏡の端で、\r\nプロデューサーが私を見てた",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602500109/6025001090130"
  },
  {
    "id": 6025001090140,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "差し入れで膨らんだビニール袋を持って",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602500109/6025001090140"
  },
  {
    "id": 6025001090150,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "美琴ー！　って、\r\n一生懸命呼んでいるの",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602500109/6025001090150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6025001090160,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "あのままステージで……っていうのも\r\n悪くなかったかもって思うけど",
    "charAnim1": "think2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_left",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602500109/6025001090160"
  },
  {
    "id": 6025001090170,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "でも、こうやって直接\r\nプロデューサーに伝えられるから、よかった",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602500109/6025001090170"
  },
  {
    "id": 6025001090180,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "ずっと、当たり前みたいに応援してくれて\r\n……ありがとうって",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602500109/6025001090180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………美琴",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6025001090190,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "大丈夫、これで終わりなんて思ってないから\r\nスタートラインから一歩、進んだだけ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602500109/6025001090190"
  },
  {
    "id": 6025001090200,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "私のなりたいアイドルには\r\nまだ、全然なれていないし",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602500109/6025001090200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……ああ、そうだよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "これからもっと、\r\n大きくて眩しいステージに立って",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "たくさんの人に、美琴が輝いているところを\r\n見てもらわないといけない",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1_s",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……何回でも",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6025001090210,
